name: Nox et tenebrae et nubila;
office-part: Hymnus;
mode: 1;
book: Antiphonale Monasticum (1934), p. 57, Nox et tenebrae;
transcriber: melody from GregoBase (chant 4153), English first stanza underlaid by syllable, to be checked;
