(c4) Hence,(h) night(h') and(h) clouds(h) that(h) night-(hi)time(h) brings,(h'_) (,) Con(h)fused(h') and(h) dark(g) and(f) trou(gh)bled(g) things;(g.) (;) The(f) dawn(h') is(h) here,(g) the(f) sky(g') grows(g) white,(h'_) (,) Christ(g) is(g') at(g) hand;(f) de(d)part(f') from(e) sight.(d.) (::)
